# Acceptance Test Plan

The system will be validated using the following criteria:

| **Test Case**               | **Expected Outcome**                                                  |
| :-------------------------- | :-------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Load PCB Image**          | Image loads successfully.                                             |
| **Detect Defects**          | Correct defects are identified accurately.                            |
| **Classify Defects**        | Correct defect class labels are displayed.                            |
| **Bounding Box Generation** | Defects are accurately localized with bounding boxes.                 |
| **Defect Count**            | Correct number of detected defects is displayed.                      |
| **Invalid Image**           | Appropriate error message is shown for unsupported or invalid images. |
| **Multiple Defects**        | All defects are detected, classified, and counted correctly.          |


